# VCS / CI
.git
.github

# Dependencies & build output — reinstalled/rebuilt inside the image.
# Excluding node_modules also prevents `COPY frontend/ ./` from clobbering
# the image's clean `npm ci` install with host (Windows) binaries.
**/node_modules
frontend/dist

# Python environments & caches
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache

# Local data & secrets
*.db
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Local-only context docs (never ship)
memory.md
features.md
idea description.md
project.md
PortfolioDocumentation.md
